bridge_certificate_payment_to_travel_payment_v01 carries payment_receipt: missing as candidate evidence that informs travel_payment_check.

Both bridge records are local proof-only records. They create no external DRS pointer, global DRS write, or production persistence. They transfer no authority, finalization, or execution. Root review is required.

5. TRAVERSAL STEPS

