Traversal can inform target checks. It cannot mark the target parent ready, finalize the target parent, execute an external action, or write global or external DRS.

6. WHY BRIDGE IS NOT AUTHORITY

DRS bridge is not authority. Traversal trace is not truth. Shared evidence can inform but cannot decide. DRS retrieval is not authority. Semantic similarity is not authority. ReuseScore is not Root.

Audit hash proves continuity, not truth. Bridge traversal is not provenance laundering.

Certificate evidence may inform travel checks, but certificate_parent_dac does not command travel_parent_dac.

